            "question": "When is the best time to visit Japan?",
            "answer": "Spring (cherry blossoms) and Autumn (fall foliage) are the most popular, offering mild weather and stunning scenery."
          },
          {
            "question": "Is the itinerary flexible?",
            "answer": "Absolutely. We build the itinerary around your pace, ensuring you have enough free time to explore spontaneously."
          },
          {
            "question": "Do I need to speak Japanese?",
            "answer": "Not at all. We provide a 24/7 bilingual concierge on WhatsApp, and English is widely understood in major cities."
          },
          {
            "question": "How do we travel between cities?",
            "answer": "We arrange all your Shinkansen (bullet train) passes and provide detailed platform instructions, making inter-city travel seamless."
          },
          {
            "question": "Can you accommodate dietary restrictions?",
            "answer": "Yes. We communicate all dietary needs to hotels and restaurants in advance to ensure a smooth culinary experience."
          },
          {
            "question": "Are private guides included?",
            "answer": "We can include private local guides for specific cultural days, while leaving other days open for independent exploration."
